(text "IEC BUS (Commodore serial, DIN-6 240deg)\nUFI acts as host: 1k pull-ups to +5V on all lines.\nIEC_x_OUT low = line pulled low (SN74LS07 open collector).\nIEC_x_IN high = line is low (74LVC14A inverter)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "479c35f0-2138-50e2-916e-4fd8543a1906"))
